					<h1>G-Trade Services</h1>
					
					<H2>Performance, Speed, Reliability - Worldwide</H2>
<P>As a member company of BNY ConvergEx Group and a Member of SIPC, G-Trade Services is an agency broker-dealer specializing in global execution services in over 50 markets worldwide.&nbsp; Through G-Tradeâs fully automated platform, clients can interact directly with every major global exchange while maintaining control of their order flow in a conflict-free, anonymous environment.&nbsp; Our sophisticated global Direct Market Access capabilities allow clients access to all major sources of liquidity and help them route to global markets quickly and efficiently.&nbsp; Clients can also leverage G-Tradeâs suite of global algorithms, tailored to each market, that use both historical and real-time market data to determine the appropriate execution timing and methodology. These orders can be executed in a matter of seconds or over an entire trading day, depending on the strategy, size of the order and volume of stock.&nbsp; G-Tradeâs state-of-the-art technology and robust, reliable connectivity are designed to handle large volumes rapidly and effectively, supporting active trading styles and rapid executions with ease.*&nbsp; G-Trade also maintains a 24-hour customer support desk and settlement team for all global markets â regardless of your location.</P>
<P><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 8pt">* Market volume and volatility, or system technical problems, may delay system access and trade execution.</SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 8pt"></SPAN></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>
